<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,018 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 110.89 pence a kilo against 112.73 last week and 118.67 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the  24,428 pkgs sold so far this year is 114.55 pence against 114.13 pence for the  26,681 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
